# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) for local development.
#
# The key the in-sandbox `claude` CLI authenticates with. It is injected into
# the container as a workspace secret, never exposed to the browser.
# For a deployed Worker use: wrangler secret put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# PUBLIC_HOSTNAME — OVERRIDE ONLY, normally leave unset.
# The host the CONTAINER uses to reach the Worker's tool bridge (/_bridge).
# Unset is correct both locally (host.docker.internal) and on a deploy, where
# it is derived from the trigger request. A wrong value shows up as
# "the tanstack MCP server hasn't come up" — which is really a 404.
# PUBLIC_HOSTNAME=

# PREVIEW_HOSTNAME — not used by this app. Browser previews go through a
# Cloudflare quick tunnel (*.trycloudflare.com), not exposePort, so no wildcard
# DNS is needed. Only relevant if you switch to the exposePort-fronted path.
# PREVIEW_HOSTNAME=
